# This package holds the global exception handling infrastructure:
# the @RestControllerAdvice exception advisor, error response builder,
# and the canonical error envelope mapping logic.
#
# All domain modules throw typed exceptions (BusinessException,
# EntityNotFoundException, UnauthorizedException) defined in
# devflow-shared-kernel. This package catches and translates them
# into the standard API error response format.
#
# Reference: docs/api/ERROR_RESPONSE_FORMAT.md
